<title>UK: Russia June seaborne crude exports 1.24 mbpd-Petra.</title>
<headline>Russia June seaborne crude exports 1.24 mbpd-Petra.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian seaborne crude exports in June totalled 1.241 million barrels per day (bpd), a little higher than in the first four months of the year, shipping inspectors Petrak said.</p>
<p>Crude exports from Black Sea terminal Novorossiisk ran at 629,736 bpd compared to 657,741 bpd in April. May comparisons were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Odessa and Tuapse shipped 227,544 bpd and 90,906 bpd respectively in June.</p>
<p>Ventspils on the Baltic moved 292,900 bpd, close to its average for the year so far.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
